      "text": "First, make sure you've registered for the webinar using the registration link you received from the organizer of the Webinar. The registration link was likely sent by email or a calendar invite. After you register you will receive a confirmation email from GoToWebinar. This email includes a link to the Webinar. To join the Webinar, click this link before the Webinar is scheduled to begin. If the webinar didn't begin, contact the organizer to find out if the session was rescheduled or canceled, or if theres a recording you can watch.",
